		'Benchmarked before landing: Sonnet 5.5 medium, stockroom-11, 1 rep per arm against b129d96f; both 11/11, rendered prompt 3,037 vs 3,494 characters, fewer cache-read tokens. Interactive-only rules were not measured (benchmarks run non-interactive). harness was a constant and was deleted; kind was dropped because the autoclose line already says whether a subagent closes. The running host must restart after renaming variables, or SYSTEM.md reports unknown keys.',
